-- Typechecks cleanly. Each #ASSERT REFUSED here fails, and none raises: a
-- failed assertion is a verdict, so `l4 run` on this file exits 0, and each
-- failure says why.

GIVETH A NUMBER
`not modelled` MEANS REFUSE "this case is not modelled"

#ASSERT REFUSED 1
#ASSERT REFUSED `not modelled` BECAUSE "some other reason"
